{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064140/block/singleImage/3269193/wm/01M7GRDWZP95REWY36F2DMZMEF.jpeg?updatedAt=1794881626\"/><figcaption>今日日間最高氣溫約28度，部分時間有陽光，明晚氣溫下降。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>天文台表示，今日 (17 日 ) 部分時間有陽光，日間最高氣溫約 28 度。吹和緩東至東南風，初時離岸風勢間中清勁。</p><p>一股偏東氣流會在今日繼續影響廣東沿岸，該區早晚較為潮濕。預料一道冷鋒會在明日 (18 日 ) 稍後橫過華南沿岸，該區北風增強及有幾陣雨，雲量增多，晚上氣溫下降。隨後一兩日顯著轉涼，周五 (20 日 ) 及周六 (21 日 ) 市區最低氣溫在 15 、 16 度左右，新界相當清涼。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:47:52.584819+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T02:13:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:50:51.214846+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:41:00.730468+00:00","content_hash":"3ad119d483cde74776924b62e9f842911a20620fe241603ffde01cf5793b8411","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:47:52.584819+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}